{"seq":3,"slug":"credit-benefit-link","title":"信用权益联动","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-benefit-link","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"traffic-payout-term-benefit","title":"流量/账期/保证金/活动权益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-benefit-link/traffic-payout-term-benefit","wordCount":2332,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-tier-pricing-fee","title":"按信用的费率/保证金差异化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-benefit-link/risk-tier-pricing-fee","wordCount":2175,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"new-merchant-coldstart","title":"新商家冷启动与初始信用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-benefit-link/new-merchant-coldstart","wordCount":2514,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"信用权益联动\">信用权益联动</h1><p>本章回答主线上的第三个问题：<strong>算出来的信用，如何换成商家真正在意的经营资源。</strong></p>\n<p>前三章建立起来的分数与等级，如果没有与任何真实资源绑定，就只是一份没人看的报表。权益联动是信用体系的兑现环节，也是整个体系最容易被做坏的一环——因为它直接触及预算、资金与利益分配。</p>\n<p><strong>第一篇讲四类权益的实现机制。</strong> 流量、账期、保证金、活动资格这四类的数学形态完全不同。流量是<strong>乘子</strong>而不是加项：应当实现为相关性分数上的权重系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>tier</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda(\\text{tier})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tier</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.15</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0.9, 1.15]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.15</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 这类量级。系数再大，信用分就取代了相关性成为排序主导因素，搜索会退化成「信用榜」，买家的体验是净损害。账期是<strong>资金时间价值</strong>，延长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 天的成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>365</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = A \\cdot c/365 \\cdot d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/365</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，只有坏账率下降带来的收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = A(p_0 - p_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖它时，延长账期在财务上才成立——这一条经常被忽略，是许多信用权益项目亏损的原因。保证金应与期望损失挂钩而非按等级拍数字。活动名额是<strong>零和资源</strong>，必须用「门槛 + 等级内排序取前 N」并用窗口函数保证排序确定。这一篇还要处理降档时的权益回收：不同类型权益的收缩速度必须不同，已报名的活动不能中途踢出商家。</p>\n<p><strong>第二篇讲差异化的定价逻辑。</strong> 等级到费率/保证金的映射本质是风险定价。每档的风险参数应从该档历史数据用收缩估计得出（钻石档商家少，直接用其历史违约率会非常不稳定），避免得出「零风险零成本」的错误结论。费率与保证金分工不同：费率作用于每笔收入，风险转移程度低；保证金作用于敞口，转移程度高。差异化应实现为相对基准的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>tier</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma(\\text{tier})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tier</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非绝对费率，并设置单期调整幅度上限，使从观察期到金牌需要多个结算周期才能走完，削弱刷分套利动机。这一篇还列出一组不可越过的护栏，其中最重要的一条是基础服务不设门槛——差异化只能作用于增量权益。</p>\n<p><strong>第三篇讲冷启动。</strong> 新商家的困境是整个体系最尖锐的矛盾：没有交易就没有数据，没有数据就定不出分，定不出分就拿不到权益，拿不到权益就更没有交易。打破这个死锁需要三件东西的组合：基于可得信息的<strong>分群先验初始分</strong>、以样本量（而非时间）为退出条件的<strong>观察期</strong>、以及保证新商家能产生数据的<strong>保底探索流量</strong>。观察期的退出不能是某天突然从先验分跳到实测分，而应让先验权重连续衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>prior</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\frac{\\kappa}{\\kappa+n}S_{\\text{prior}} + \\frac{n}{\\kappa+n}S_{\\text{obs}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0987em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">κ</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">κ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prior</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0987em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">κ</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。保底流量必须设双重退出（样本达标或超时），否则商家会故意维持低销量以长期享受配额。</p>\n<p>三篇的阅读顺序建议是先第一篇（理解权益形态）再第二篇（理解定价约束）最后第三篇（理解新商家特例）。若只关心某个具体问题：想知道「流量加权会不会让搜索变差」看第一篇，想知道「为什么保证金要收这么多」看第二篇，想知道「新商家为什么起步这么慢」看第三篇。</p>\n<p>本章的上游是 <a href=\"../credit-tier-badge/credit-tier-threshold\">信用等级与阈值</a>——没有等级就没有权益映射的输入；本章的下游是第四章，因为<strong>权益一旦授予就必须能被回滚</strong>，这要求权益记录引用分数流水。</p>\n"}